> I have a couple of 3.1 questions- exactly what alignment do you need to get theplatinum yendorian express card, and what chracater do you need to be able to #apply it?

The PYEC is a neutral artifact (from the Tourist's quest).  If you're not
neutral, you get blasted from it (but I think you can still wish for it, if
you're brave).  Checked in wizard mode, can wish for it if not neutral, but
get blasted.

> 
> I was also wondering how one can get rid of rust. I have a rusty +6 mjollnir that I want to de-rust.

Rustproof it.  Rustproofing a weapon, or erodeproofing armor, removes all
rust (erosion firedamage etc).

> 
> Oh, one last question: to get chromatic dragon scale mail, do I need more than the green,red,yello,and blue dragons? I saw a white dragon somwhere, and I hearthere are fancy dragons like black, and gold, and platinum too.

Tain't no such thing as chromatic dragon scale mail (checked the source and
in wizard, I'm pretty sure I'm right).  Dragons are available in gray, red,
white, orange, black, blue, green, and yellow.  The chromatic dragon is the
Caveman's quest nemisis.

